an begin="1:21.559" end="1:22.763">照亮</span><span begin="1:22.763" end="1:23.130">的</span><span begin="1:23.130" end="1:23.647">我</span><span begin="1:23.647" end="1:23.897">并</span><span begin="1:23.897" end="1:25.061">不孤</span><span begin="1:25.061" end="1:26.035">单</span></p><p begin="1:26.355" end="1:30.777" itunes:key="L11" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:26.355" end="1:27.305">亲人未</span><span begin="1:27.305" end="1:28.264">散</span> <span begin="1:28.470" end="1:29.635">热腾腾的</span><span begin="1:29.635" end="1:30.777">饭</span></p><p begin="1:31.649" end="1:35.246" itunes:key="L12" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:31.649" end="1:31.971">在</span><span begin="1:31.971" end="1:33.102">我梦里都</span><span begin="1:33.102" end="1:33.702">有</span> <span begin="1:33.702" end="1:34.253">你</span><span begin="1:34.253" end="1:35.246">看</span></p></div><div begin="1:35.369" end="1:54.171" itunes:songPart="Chorus"><p begin="1:35.369" end="1:39.706" itunes:key="L13" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:35.369" end="1:36.630">守村的呐</span><span begin="1:36.630" end="1:37.471">喊</span> <span begin="1:37.690" end="1:38.982">犬猫就围</span><span begin="1:38.982" end="1:39.706">满</span></p><p begin="1:39.716" end="1:44.541" itunes:key="L14" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:39.716" end="1:40.508">听我</span><span begin="1:40.508" end="1:41.148">吹</span> <span begin="1:41.237" end="1:41.538">会</span><span begin="1:41.538" end="1:42.028">长</span><span begin="1:42.028" end="1:42.368">鼻</span><span begin="1:42.368" end="1:43.584">的勇</span><span begin="1:43.584" end="1:44.541">敢</span></p><p begin="1:44.594" end="1:49.495" itunes:key="L15" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:44.594" end="1:45.847">嘿船长你</span><span begin="1:45.847" end="1:46.697">看</span> <span begin="1:46.986" end="1:48.146">我早有预</span><span begin="1:48.146" end="1:49.495">感</span></p><p begin="1:50.348" end="1:54.171" itunes:key="L16" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:50.348" end="1:51.793">很强的人</span><span begin="1:51.793" end="1:52.938">都孤</span><spa